Package: wayparam-gui
Source: wayparam
Version: 0.4.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Aleff <alessandro.greco.1@protonmail.com>
Installed-Size: 53
Depends: wayparam (= 0.4.0-1), python3:any
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/aleff-github/wayparam
Description: local web interface for wayparam
 wayparam collects historical URLs with query parameters from the Internet
 Archive Wayback CDX API. This package adds wayparam-gui, which serves a small
 web interface on the loopback interface and streams results to the browser as
 they are found.
 .
 The interface binds to 127.0.0.1 only, requires a per-process random token on
 every request and rejects unexpected Host headers, because it performs
 outbound requests on behalf of whoever can reach it.
 .
 Install this package only if you want the interface: the wayparam command
 itself has no use for it.
